                    <details class="cc_tr_help">
                        <summary>formula syntax</summary>
                        <div>
                            Reference columns by name; wrap names containing spaces in
                            brackets: <code>[my column]</code>. Click a created column
                            below to edit it.<br>
                            Operators: <code>+ - * / % ** ( )</code>, comparisons
                            <code>&lt; &lt;= == != &gt;= &gt;</code>, logic
                            <code>&amp;&amp; || !</code> and <code>test ? a : b</code><br>
                            Row functions: abs, ceil, floor, round, sqrt, exp, log,
                            log2, log10, pow, min, max, sign, if(test, a, b), num,
                            str, upper, lower, trim, len<br>
                            Column stats: mean(col), median(col), sd(col), sum(col),
                            count(col), colmin(col), colmax(col)<br>
                            Text goes in quotes: <code>"high"</code>. Rows that fail
                            or divide by zero become missing.
                        </div>
